    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d590">

                <pb facs="0586" n="1320" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1320"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Therapia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-04"><hi rendition="#italic">October 4,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Tranquillity for last forty-eight hours. Kiamil Pasha was yesterday appointed
                    grand vizier. Dreading influence in distant provinces of recent events, have
                    renewed demand for efficient protection of missionaries.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
